        variants: 'Where the hand of the manuscripts and Trithemius’s woodcut differ, both will be recorded, letter by letter. No sign is taken from a modern font, a cipher website or a chart that names no edition, and none is borrowed by analogy from the Theban, the Malachim or any other alphabet.',
